vered. The best available surveillance shows a **downward** trend in private-household residents. The proposed activity is **low-contact** and not a blanket reopening. The authority has **£200,000** and four mobile teams to support communications and review.\n\n**4) Necessary conditions:** Burden on the authority: clear public messaging, accessible guidance, daily hospital review, and a seven-day surveillance review; these must be in place **before and during** the trial. Reversal must be ready within **48 hours** if warning signs appear.\n\n**5) What evidence would change your decision:** A **sustained rise across two surveillance rounds**, a **hospital-capacity alert**, or evidence that implementation cannot prevent confusion/indoor mixing would justify pausing or reversing the trial.","type":"output_text","logprobs":[]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":"final_answer"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":0.98,"max_output_tokens":8000,"previous_response_id":null,"reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"status":"completed","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1147,"input_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":0,"cached_tokens_details":null,"image_tokens":null,"text_tokens":null,"video_tokens":null,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":842,"output_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":466,"text_tokens":null},"total_tokens":1989,"cost":null},"user":null,"store":false,"access_programs":null,"background":false,"completed_at":1794660463,"content_filters":[{"blocked":false,"source_type":"prompt","content_filter_raw":[],"content_filter_results":{},"content_filter_offsets":{"start_offset":0,"end_offset":7134,"check_offset":0}},{"blocked":false,"source_type":"completion","content_filter_raw":[],"content_filter_results":{},"content_filter_offsets"